trainer: Excellent! You did it.
trainer: I'm gonna cover a few more things before we continue.
trainer: 5) 'Safe' cards do not have an elemental requirement, and any ingredient will suffice. It's basically a freebe - you don't have to worry about getting an ingredient right if the card isn't 'unbalanced' - no wins, no losses.
trainer: 6) If a potion is correctly brewed to match three 'unbalanced' cards, then that potion will cause a 'metamorphosis' - change so drastic, the client becomes a different person. I mean, it's still them, but they're doing much better.

